1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,100
I spent so much time trying to understand why people hurt me.

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:09,540
I kept searching for reasons for their distance, their inconsistency.

3
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,980
The way they could walk away so easily without looking back,

4
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:19,450
but eventually I realized I was giving kindness to people

5
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:22,750
who never noticed how deeply they were breaking my heart.
